      "title": "Zigbee Direct: Fixed 'Segmentation fault' due to dereferencing a NULL pointer.",
      "message": "Zigbee Direct: Fixed 'Segmentation fault' due to dereferencing a NULL pointer.\n\nZigbee Direct packets relayed over BLE interface will not have IEEE/MAC\nheader, as a result 'ieee_hints' can be NULL.\n\nChanges part of this commit ensure, 'ieee_hints' is not NULL before it is dereferenced.\n",
      "author_name": "Mohammed Suhel",
      "author_email": "mhs@exegin.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-08-08T12:39:59.000+05:30",
      "committer_name": "Mohammed Suhel",
